[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mSYMBOLS.md[0m** — C exports 10 symbols, Rust exports the same 10, [38;5;10mnm -D[0m diff empty. The whole C library is one translation unit and nothing was left untranslated, so no missing modules to write. Rust's extra undefined symbols are all libc/unwind runtime.[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mCONFIGS.md[0m** — 34 rows, all passing. Every row uses many seeded-random inputs plus a boundary grid, and compares return values, all 12 raw [38;5;10mComputeState[0m bytes, [1mand[22m the exact bytes written to fd 1. Rows include the low-level exports driven directly, cross-library function pointers in both directions, a [38;5;10mComputeState[0m mutated alternately by both libraries, and [38;5;10mcheckshift[0m reassembled by the test from its six constituent exports across all 64 C/Rust stage-assignment masks.[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m** — 19 rows, all passing, each asserting the [3msame[23m sentinel rather than "both failed". Includes out-of-range opcode ints crossing the FFI boundary (note [38;5;10mOP_SHIFT == 4[0m is itself out of range for [38;5;10mget_operation[0m, whose table is indexed 0..3), null [38;5;10m%s[0m rendering as [38;5;10m(null)[0m, the [38;5;10mcount > 4[0m clamp, and the check-order dependency in [38;5;10mapply_operation[0m.[0m[0m
- **Every configuration** — [38;5;10mscripts/check_features.sh[0m derives the feature powerset from [38;5;10mCargo.toml[0m mechanically (none declared, so [38;5;10m{--all-features, --no-default-features}[0m) and runs symbol parity plus the full suite against the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m built in both [38;5;10mrelease[0m and [38;5;10mdev[0m. 59 tests × 4 configurations, all green; [38;5;10mcargo check --all-targets[0m is warning-free.[0m[0m
